  "notes": "Beethoven WoO 59, A section (bars 1-8) with its repeat written out = 16 bars of 3/8, ending on A4 (first-ending quarter). Source: Mutopia transcription of Breitkopf & Haertel 1888. Pickup E5-D#5 (two 16ths = 0.5 beats); repeat pickup sits in bar 8. Old repo rhythm was wrong (quarter/eighth instead of 16ths, 28 bars). LH added (tags lack two-hands): composer's broken chords A2-E3-A3 / E2-E3-G#3 as 16ths, tacet in bars 1 and 5. Validation exceptions (intermediate): 16th notes are the composer's rhythm; D#5 is a chromatic neighbour. Suggest adding a two-hands tag."
